**A governed AI software development and engineering platform.**

Aletheon Forge helps engineering organizations coordinate AI agents, software repositories, technical knowledge, engineering memory, and human leadership.

The platform enables organizations to use AI coding tools consistently and securely rather than allowing each engineer or agent to operate independently.

